			],
			"Message": "chore(Grove): Update WASM and telemetry dependency versions\n\nBump wasmparser from 0.247 to 0.248, opentelemetry-otlp from 0.31 to 0.32, and opentelemetry-semantic-conventions from 0.31 to 0.32 in Cargo.toml.\n\nThese patch updates align the Grove extension host with the latest stable releases, improving WASM parsing compatibility and telemetry export reliability.",
